    "body": "Scope change after a maintainer decision (2026-11-11): the program's unit is to come from a document-level setting, not from the machine file or the post - filed as #902.\n\nSo this issue is narrowed to its safety part: each of the five posts (Fanuc, Haas, Mazak, Sinumerik, Doosan DNM) states in its opening block the unit it actually writes (mm today), before any motion. The earlier \"refuse an inch machine file by name\" option is dropped: the machine file's unit will stop choosing the program unit (#902), and a mm program that says so is correct, not silent. Inch output for these posts is #902.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
